WEBVTT

00:36.540 --> 00:38.170
Check this out!

00:39.460 --> 00:44.130
It's an enoki mushroom! They taste great with soy sauce!

00:44.500 --> 00:47.880
There she goes again! Haruka's so weird!

00:47.880 --> 00:50.290
I don't get it, but it's still funny!

00:51.750 --> 00:54.790
Ooh, ooh, make a matsutake mushroom next!

00:54.790 --> 00:55.750
You got it!

00:56.040 --> 00:57.210
All right!

01:03.290 --> 01:06.170
Who's that? Does she want to play with us?

01:06.540 --> 01:10.630
That's Korisu-chan. She always plays by herself.

01:15.920 --> 01:19.880
Hello, there! I heard your name's
Korisu-chan. Is that right?

01:21.330 --> 01:24.920
I'm Pipi the Fairy! Would you care to join me?

01:28.250 --> 01:31.170
My, aren't you a well-mannered lady!

01:38.670 --> 01:39.540
So cute!

01:41.000 --> 01:41.710
Touching!

01:44.000 --> 01:44.880
So cool!

01:46.080 --> 01:46.830
Charming!

01:55.080 --> 02:00.330
Sunny like the light above, shining bright

02:00.330 --> 02:05.670
That warm, happy smile is so perfect and right

02:05.830 --> 02:11.080
Even when you're sad and tears roll down your cheeks

02:11.210 --> 02:16.000
That's part of what makes you perfect to me

02:16.380 --> 02:21.580
All I can do right now is look up at you in the sky

02:21.750 --> 02:29.830
But I believe in the strength growing in my heart

02:29.960 --> 02:32.420
I'm not just gushing over you

02:32.670 --> 02:35.040
I'm not just dreaming about being you

02:35.210 --> 02:37.830
I want to be, I want to change

02:38.000 --> 02:40.500
This love will power me through it all

02:40.750 --> 02:46.920
It all started that day you stole my heart

02:46.920 --> 02:53.460
My love will never fade, My Dream Girls

02:53.750 --> 02:54.710
So cute!

02:56.040 --> 02:56.830
Touching!

02:59.130 --> 02:59.960
So cool!

03:01.130 --> 03:01.960
Charming!

03:06.790 --> 03:10.420
<b>The Tres Magia's Secret Backstory</b>

03:13.790 --> 03:16.040
You're gonna pay for this, bitch!

03:19.170 --> 03:20.080
Azure!

03:22.000 --> 03:23.920
How unsightly...

03:24.210 --> 03:28.250
But I need to see more
of that beautiful skin you're hiding!

03:28.630 --> 03:33.540
You wanna beg for mercy, now's your chance!
Not like it's gonna stop us.

03:33.880 --> 03:35.790
Your vile game ends here, villains!

03:45.460 --> 03:47.880
NO!

03:51.250 --> 03:52.170
Those assholes!

03:52.460 --> 03:56.580
I'm gonna kill 'em for messing with us like that!

03:56.830 --> 03:58.960
And Sayo, you gotta get your shit together!

03:59.170 --> 04:00.290
S-sorry...

04:00.920 --> 04:04.130
But you fared no better than I did this time, Kaoruko.

04:04.880 --> 04:06.130
Wanna say that again?

04:06.670 --> 04:08.000
Stop!

04:08.500 --> 04:09.710
No fighting!

04:10.040 --> 04:12.080
C'mon, Kaoruko-chan,
turn that grumpy frown upside down!

04:12.630 --> 04:13.710
You, too, Sayo-chan!

04:13.710 --> 04:17.080
You keep making that face, and it'll get stuck on there!

04:17.500 --> 04:18.880
I know.

04:18.880 --> 04:20.830
See? It's already stuck!

04:21.380 --> 04:25.420
We're gonna be fine! We'll just try again tomorrow!

04:26.000 --> 04:27.540
R-right.

04:27.710 --> 04:30.540
Geez, Haruka, way to be the team mom.

04:31.880 --> 04:34.710
Team Mom? You think so?

04:36.000 --> 04:39.330
Whoa! I guess I kinda am!

04:43.330 --> 04:46.170
May I present to you Haruka's
Super-Special Mushroom Lunch!

04:46.580 --> 04:48.580
C'mon, now, dig in!

04:49.880 --> 04:50.920
Wow.

04:51.170 --> 04:52.170
The hell is this?

04:52.630 --> 04:54.460
We're gonna need all the power we can
get to beat Enormita!

04:54.460 --> 04:56.380
That means getting the right balance
of nutrients and eating healthy!

04:58.880 --> 05:01.000
Mmm, so good!

05:04.040 --> 05:08.080
So I've got an idea for a new attack formation.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.040
It's bound to blow our enemies away!

05:11.880 --> 05:12.960
Formation?

05:13.170 --> 05:17.420
First, I fly in like this,
then you loop around like this, Sayo-chan,

05:17.880 --> 05:20.040
with Kaoruko-chan coming in this way...

05:20.710 --> 05:22.750
Wait, was it the other way?

05:23.040 --> 05:25.830
No, wait, I was supposed to go that way...

05:29.710 --> 05:34.790
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two! One!

05:35.630 --> 05:38.540
C'mon, Kaoruko-chan! Put your back into it!

05:39.000 --> 05:41.040
One, two! One, two!

05:41.170 --> 05:43.920
Wanna explain why we're doing this again?
One, two! One, two! One, two! One!<b></b>

05:45.000 --> 05:46.290
Kaoruko-chan?

05:46.290 --> 05:47.710
Y-you okay?

05:49.670 --> 05:53.080
C'mon, dance, monkey, dance!

05:53.250 --> 05:54.540
Kiwi-chan...

05:56.080 --> 05:59.670
Least my brain's bigger than
the flea-sized speck in your noggin.

05:59.880 --> 06:03.210
Stop! Kaoruko-chan, don't be mean,
or I'll give you a time-out!

06:03.420 --> 06:07.630
Sorry, Kiwi-chan, Utena-chan.

06:07.750 --> 06:10.460
I hope this hasn't changed how you feel
about my darling Kaoruko-chan.

06:11.500 --> 06:13.500
Uh-huh...

06:13.630 --> 06:15.290
Oh, wait a sec!

06:17.210 --> 06:18.580
Here, have these!

06:19.290 --> 06:21.080
Wait, for real?! Hell yeah!

06:21.080 --> 06:24.630
Th-thank you very much.

06:25.000 --> 06:26.920
Staying hydrated is important!

06:27.920 --> 06:29.630
Haruka's acting a lot like...

06:30.210 --> 06:31.420
...she's our mom.

06:36.170 --> 06:37.630
Korisu-chan!

06:39.630 --> 06:41.130
Sorry, did I keep you waiting?

06:43.130 --> 06:45.130
What do you wanna play today?

06:49.290 --> 06:50.040
Thought so!

06:54.580 --> 06:58.670
It's morning! Wake up, sleepyhead!

06:58.830 --> 07:01.130
Your friends are waiting to play with you!

07:02.000 --> 07:03.170
Good morning!

07:05.380 --> 07:07.880
My, you're such a good girl!

07:08.250 --> 07:10.670
Mommy Pipi is so proud of you!

07:13.540 --> 07:16.210
It's time for your milkies!

07:33.290 --> 07:37.130
That was so much fun! I was really getting into it.

07:38.080 --> 07:41.000
Korisu-chan, you sure love playing house, don't you?

07:44.380 --> 07:46.880
I can always play Mom for you!

07:50.170 --> 07:53.460
How's it this late already?! I gotta go get groceries!

08:00.290 --> 08:00.830
Here!

08:05.170 --> 08:07.750
Let's play again sometime, Korisu-chan!

08:11.210 --> 08:12.420
Bye-bye!

08:23.170 --> 08:28.210
Salty shiokara, oranges, romanesco!

08:28.420 --> 08:30.880
Hi, Haruka-chan! Doing some errands?

08:31.330 --> 08:34.080
Yup! Got any romanesco?

08:34.250 --> 08:34.920
Nope.

08:35.000 --> 08:39.710
Aww! I gotta figure out what else to do
for tomorrow's lunch...

08:39.960 --> 08:45.500
<b>Maitake Mushrooms</b>

08:40.080 --> 08:41.920
It's gotta give us energy but also be delicious,

08:41.920 --> 08:45.210
something the two of them can really chow down on...

08:47.790 --> 08:52.040
Uh-oh. I must've drank too much water,
'cause I really gotta pee...

08:53.960 --> 08:56.210
I sense something... Enormita?!

09:00.670 --> 09:02.210
She's always on the go...

09:04.130 --> 09:05.380
They're close.

09:06.380 --> 09:09.290
Wait a sec... This is the park I was just at!

09:18.580 --> 09:19.670
Neroalice!

09:25.670 --> 09:26.920
The dollhouse!

09:27.880 --> 09:30.040
I gotta make sure I don't end up inside...

09:30.790 --> 09:32.750
And I gotta call Sulfur and Azure before...

09:37.500 --> 09:38.210
What...?

09:44.540 --> 09:48.880
I can't believe I got caught that easily, AGAIN!
I really gotta get my act together.

09:49.750 --> 09:51.540
After all, I'm supposed to be a...

09:52.130 --> 09:55.080
A... What?

09:56.130 --> 09:57.420
What am I again?

09:58.500 --> 10:01.080
Oh, right... I'm...

10:01.960 --> 10:05.250
I'm... a baby!

10:13.540 --> 10:16.170
I'm all alone!

10:18.420 --> 10:21.250
I don't wanna be alone! I'm scared!

10:21.960 --> 10:25.750
Someone come help me!

10:27.540 --> 10:30.710
Who's that? Are they gonna help me?

10:33.630 --> 10:34.750
Mommy!

10:39.920 --> 10:42.460
I was so scared, Mommy!

10:43.080 --> 10:48.000
But I feel better now. Thanks, Mommy!

10:49.420 --> 10:51.290
Hey, what can I getcha?

10:52.290 --> 10:54.630
One order of takoyaki, without the tako.

10:54.960 --> 10:57.880
What? This is a takoyaki joint, y'know.

10:57.880 --> 11:00.920
One order of takoyaki, without the tako.

11:11.500 --> 11:13.790
I hope you're excited for tomorrow's lunch!

11:15.960 --> 11:21.500
Why's she making us lunch?
She's taking this Mom shit too seriously.

11:23.630 --> 11:27.330
So I thought an iguana might be cool, too, and...

11:29.080 --> 11:30.210
I'm so sorry!

11:30.330 --> 11:32.920
You need to look where you're walking.

11:33.210 --> 11:36.880
Hey, it's fine. No harm done, mmkay?

11:39.130 --> 11:40.790
Don't worry your pretty head about it.

11:42.830 --> 11:44.460
Who's that girl again?

11:44.750 --> 11:47.130
That's Tenkawa-san. She just transferred in.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.710
Morning, Tenkawa-san!

11:55.670 --> 11:57.420
You get it all out, Tenkawa-san?

11:59.130 --> 12:00.960
Have some of this, Tenkawa-san!

12:07.500 --> 12:09.920
Let's walk home together, Tenkawa-san!

12:11.960 --> 12:16.250
All right, what's the deal? You want something from me?

12:16.540 --> 12:21.290
Yup! I wanna be friends with you, Tenkawa-san!

12:22.830 --> 12:23.630
What?

12:25.420 --> 12:29.250
Guess she's just as annoying as she's always been.

12:37.080 --> 12:39.000
This is fun!

12:39.500 --> 12:42.460
I'm so happy!

12:43.080 --> 12:45.170
Mama! I love you, Mama!

12:45.630 --> 12:47.670
I love you so much!

12:57.630 --> 13:01.170
Mama, I'm sorry!

13:01.580 --> 13:05.920
I can't do anything. I can't even go potty.

13:07.210 --> 13:07.790
Huh?

13:09.790 --> 13:14.330
Mommy's smiling. Is it okay? You're not mad?

13:17.750 --> 13:19.630
Thank you, Mommy!

13:20.580 --> 13:25.000
I'm just a baby. It's okay that I can't do anything.

13:26.130 --> 13:30.630
I don't gotta work hard like the other two.

13:32.330 --> 13:36.580
Huh? What other two? Who?

13:37.670 --> 13:39.540
I know them...

13:40.040 --> 13:43.710
They're strong, and cool,

13:44.500 --> 13:48.080
and they're both really important to me...

13:49.170 --> 13:52.210
And I'm...

13:52.920 --> 13:54.630
I'm...

13:56.000 --> 13:59.420
Hey, let's hit up the takoyaki stand on the way home!

14:00.040 --> 14:01.920
I hear they updated their menu.

14:02.040 --> 14:02.670
Sure.

14:05.040 --> 14:06.000
Sayo-chan!

14:14.710 --> 14:15.580
This way!

14:15.580 --> 14:16.670
Hurry!

14:19.040 --> 14:19.830
Oh, no...

14:20.750 --> 14:21.830
Were we too late?!

14:22.420 --> 14:24.080
HIYA!

14:24.630 --> 14:25.250
Huh...?

14:25.830 --> 14:33.830
Who the fuck do you think you're fucking with, huh?!

14:36.420 --> 14:37.580
Tenkawa-san?!

14:37.580 --> 14:39.290
Yeah?!

14:40.580 --> 14:43.830
What? Why didn't I run away?

14:44.080 --> 14:45.330
Y-yeah.

14:45.670 --> 14:48.080
You could've gotten hurt trying to fight it yourself.

14:49.380 --> 14:51.920
So I should've run away like a bitch instead?

14:52.420 --> 14:55.250
Like I was gonna let this little shit think it owns me.

14:58.750 --> 15:00.580
And who are you guys?

15:00.750 --> 15:04.290
What's with the outfits? Some kind of cosplay shit?

15:04.460 --> 15:06.040
No, no!

15:06.790 --> 15:09.920
We're magical girls!

15:12.750 --> 15:19.250
That's right. We're magical girls.

15:19.920 --> 15:23.210
So I'm... I'm not...

15:24.210 --> 15:27.380
I'm not a...

15:27.670 --> 15:29.960
I'm not a baby at all, am I?

15:36.250 --> 15:39.000
Where's my skirt and undies?!

15:40.420 --> 15:42.250
She... She...!

15:42.710 --> 15:46.710
She was staring straight at my you-know-what!

15:47.040 --> 15:48.210
Forget that for a sec!

15:48.420 --> 15:51.130
Gimme back my undies!

15:55.130 --> 15:59.080
What? Why does she look so sad?

16:01.880 --> 16:05.790
Wait a sec, were you... having fun playing with me?

16:11.710 --> 16:15.080
She looks sad... Did she want to keep playing?

16:15.880 --> 16:16.710
Wait...

16:21.290 --> 16:24.000
M-Mommy?

16:34.210 --> 16:37.330
Seriously, why am I doing this?

16:40.630 --> 16:44.040
When I look at Neroalice, though...

16:47.830 --> 16:49.420
I just feel like...

16:54.500 --> 16:58.080
Like I can't let her go without a smile.

17:04.080 --> 17:06.170
Magia Magenta is here!

17:07.330 --> 17:09.540
Say your prayers, Enormita!

17:10.380 --> 17:11.750
Your evil plans...

17:11.920 --> 17:13.580
...end here!

17:15.880 --> 17:19.420
What?! Why?! Why don't you want to?!

17:19.880 --> 17:25.130
You're the ones makin' no sense.
Why do you want me to be a magical girl?

17:25.380 --> 17:27.380
Because you've got what it takes!

17:27.830 --> 17:31.420
I saw how you punched that monster!
It gave me goosebumps!

17:31.920 --> 17:35.250
Come help us put a stop to evil and save the world.

17:36.170 --> 17:37.750
Sounds like a pain.

17:38.000 --> 17:39.500
Oh, not at all!

17:39.500 --> 17:45.000
It feels good to help everyone!
And we can do so much more working together!

17:45.750 --> 17:46.670
Plus...

17:50.630 --> 17:55.210
The moment I met you, I had a feeling that you'd join us!

17:57.960 --> 18:00.250
From that very first moment, huh?

18:00.790 --> 18:06.540
She's a ditz and a pain in the ass,
always acting without thinking, but...

18:07.420 --> 18:10.170
It's okay, because we've got each other!

18:11.880 --> 18:16.250
Haruka's unabashed positivity has changed my life.

18:16.540 --> 18:18.460
I wanna be Magenta next!

18:18.540 --> 18:20.080
Then I'll be Azure!

18:20.080 --> 18:22.710
Hey, I don't wanna be Sulfur again!

18:24.250 --> 18:26.880
I wanna be Magenta, too!

18:26.880 --> 18:27.670
Aww...

18:27.670 --> 18:32.710
The hell? What's wrong with Sulfur?
I'm gonna teach her a lesson...

18:33.000 --> 18:34.710
It's gettin' late, girls!

18:35.130 --> 18:36.460
Let's head home!

18:36.830 --> 18:37.880
Okay!

18:38.460 --> 18:40.000
What's for dinner?

18:40.380 --> 18:44.250
No idea, but it'll give you world-saving energy, mmkay?

18:44.250 --> 18:46.750
What's that supposed to mean, Mom?

18:48.420 --> 18:50.540
Our team mom, huh?

18:53.040 --> 18:54.540
<b>TUTORING</b>

18:53.880 --> 18:54.460
I sense something!

18:54.710 --> 18:55.670
A monster!

19:03.330 --> 19:07.630
I-I can't take it anymore...

19:11.830 --> 19:12.960
Mommy...

19:14.080 --> 19:15.170
I need to...

19:15.750 --> 19:17.630
I-I gotta...

19:18.080 --> 19:18.880
I gotta...

19:21.210 --> 19:23.750
N-no, don't push on it!

19:25.540 --> 19:26.710
I can't hold it!

19:31.630 --> 19:34.080
B-but...

19:34.500 --> 19:36.880
I shouldn't.

19:38.330 --> 19:39.960
I'm not really a baby...

19:41.080 --> 19:43.420
M-mommy...

19:50.420 --> 19:52.830
I can't hold it...

20:05.250 --> 20:07.540
I peed my pants...

20:08.130 --> 20:10.830
A magical girl just peed her pants...

20:12.040 --> 20:13.920
I'm... I'm so embarrassed.

20:14.330 --> 20:18.920
But why do I feel so...

20:23.540 --> 20:24.250
Huh?

20:24.580 --> 20:25.330
Ow!

20:26.500 --> 20:29.170
Wait, what?! How?

20:34.420 --> 20:35.960
H-hold it!

20:36.290 --> 20:38.290
What are you really after?!

20:44.750 --> 20:45.830
Neroalice?!

20:50.080 --> 20:50.960
Magenta!

20:51.830 --> 20:53.130
Azure! Sulfur!

20:54.130 --> 20:54.880
Sorry!

20:54.880 --> 20:55.920
We should've come quicker!

20:57.830 --> 21:01.670
S-seems like... it was a fierce battle.

21:02.130 --> 21:02.670
Hello?

21:02.830 --> 21:06.290
Yeah, it was really rough...

21:07.710 --> 21:10.290
Wait, my undies! Where'd they go?!

21:12.750 --> 21:14.330
All better!

21:14.790 --> 21:17.000
So tell us, what the hell happened?

21:17.460 --> 21:18.580
Well...

21:20.750 --> 21:23.170
Whatever it was, I feel a lot better now!

21:25.580 --> 21:26.540
Sheesh.

21:28.330 --> 21:29.500
You big weirdo.

21:31.710 --> 21:34.380
Oh yeah, I've got a question about lunch tomorrow!

21:35.580 --> 21:38.880
The local fishmonger's got a big sale going on.

21:39.170 --> 21:43.880
So I thought I'd put together
an octopus and mushroom feast!

21:41.210 --> 21:44.460
<b>TAKO-TASTIC</b>

21:41.210 --> 21:44.460
<b>OCTOPUS SALE!</b>

21:45.790 --> 21:49.460
What the hell?! You know I hate octopus!

21:49.460 --> 21:51.750
And you should stop being so picky, Kaoruko-chan!

21:52.330 --> 21:54.670
It's more than just the octopus...

21:55.040 --> 21:57.630
You seriously still trying to be our mom?

21:57.920 --> 22:00.080
Sure! I can be your mom!

22:01.630 --> 22:03.460
Actually, why don't you call me Mommy?

22:03.460 --> 22:05.170
Like we're babies?! No thanks!

22:08.130 --> 22:13.790
Truth is, I want to be cuter, want to be sweeter

22:13.960 --> 22:16.790
I can't help that I'm a bad girl, sorry

22:17.670 --> 22:19.920
I just wanna bully you

22:20.210 --> 22:25.830
You're so precious, so perfect, I love you so much it hurts

22:26.000 --> 22:32.960
But the love I want to give you is brutally sadistic

22:33.130 --> 22:35.920
I was just a sweet girl

22:36.170 --> 22:39.040
Innocently dreaming of being the main character

22:39.210 --> 22:44.790
Wondering sadly why I couldn't be like that

22:44.790 --> 22:50.670
Then boom, it came to me, and suddenly I was under its spell

22:50.790 --> 22:53.750
I can't focus on school or anything

22:53.750 --> 22:56.920
I'm stuck fantasizing about every situation

22:57.080 --> 23:02.290
Lighting the fuse and having some explosive fun

23:02.670 --> 23:08.170
Might not be so bad after all

23:08.170 --> 23:13.830
Truth is, I want to be cuter, want to be sweeter

23:14.000 --> 23:19.710
But I'm gonna write my own story, walk my own path for me

23:20.080 --> 23:22.250
I wanna see her shine brighter

23:22.250 --> 23:25.790
I wanna see her be even more powerful

23:26.000 --> 23:33.040
So accept my special kind of love, this top-shelf fetish

23:36.130 --> 23:41.000
<b>Azure in Trouble!</b>
